        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners McDonnells are excited to bring this large 2.11 Acre Site for sale in an Idyllic Country Setting.\r\nSituated in a Quiet Cul-De-Sac setting c.1km outside Castletown Village & \r\nc.8 Miles from Mullingar Town & 2 mins from Castletown Primary School\r\nSubject to planning permission\r\n\r\nPrice Guide:  €100,000\r\n\r\nLocation\r\nCastletown Geoghegan is one of Westmeath's most sought-after rural villages, renowned for its welcoming community, excellent primary school and beautiful countryside.\r\nIt’s just c.5 mins drive to the M6, c.40 mins from M50, Kilbeggan 7 mins & c. Mullingar 12 mins so all in all, it’s a very centrally located \r\nc.1.km from Castletown Village & just mins to Castletown Primary School & Church\r\nNearby attractions include Lough Ennell, Lough Owel, Lough Derravaragh, Belvedere House & Gardens, the River Brosna, and the Mullingar–Athlone Greenway, offering an exceptional lifestyle for outdoor enthusiasts. Mullingar provides an extensive range of shopping, restaurants, cafés, schools and sporting facilities, while Dublin is within comfortable commuting distance via the nearby M6."
      }
